### Feature GarmentTypes — DELETE físico / lógico (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
# access_token: POST /api/sesion/login (features/auth/session/http/session.http) o npm run dev:token -- admin
@token = pega-aqui-el-access-token

### Borrado lógico
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tipos-prenda/1/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borrado físico
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tipos-prenda/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
